column name : potential usage  
• `pickup_datetime` (tlc_yellow_trips_2016) : restrict the analysis to 2016‑01‑01 – 2016‑01‑07 (inclusive).  
• `dropoff_datetime` (tlc_yellow_trips_2016) : keep only trips where the drop‑off occurred after the pick‑up.  
• `passenger_count` (tlc_yellow_trips_2016) : keep rows with a positive number of passengers.  
• `trip_distance` / `tip_amount` / `fare_amount` / `mta_tax` / `tolls_amount` / `total_amount` (tlc_yellow_trips_2016) : discard records that have negative values.  
• `pickup_location_id` (tlc_yellow_trips_2016) : link each trip to a taxi zone (and therefore to its borough).  
• `zone_id` (taxi_zone_geom) : primary key to join with `pickup_location_id`.  
• `borough` (taxi_zone_geom) : borough to group by; exclude ‘EWR’ and ‘Staten Island’.  
• calculated field `tip_rate` : tip percentage for each trip → classify it into seven buckets  
  – 0 % (no tip)  
  – 0 % < tip_rate ≤ 5 %  
  – 5 % < tip_rate ≤ 10 %  
  – 10 % < tip_rate ≤ 15 %  
  – 15 % < tip_rate ≤ 20 %  
  – 20 % < tip_rate ≤ 25 %  
  – 25 % < tip_rate  

main filter block (will be reused)  
```
WHERE DATE(pickup_datetime) BETWEEN '2016‑01‑01' AND '2016‑01‑07'
  AND dropoff_datetime > pickup_datetime
  AND passenger_count > 0
  AND trip_distance       >= 0
  AND tip_amount          >= 0
  AND tolls_amount        >= 0
  AND mta_tax             >= 0
  AND fare_amount         >= 0
  AND total_amount        >= 0
```
exclusion of unwanted pickup boroughs after joining  
```
AND borough NOT IN ('EWR','Staten Island')
```

Below are ten illustrative BigQuery queries (each limited to 20 rows) that go from very basic inspection to the complete answer.

```sql
-- 1) Description: peek at a few 2016 yellow‑cab trips (raw fields)
SELECT *
FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016`
WHERE DATE(pickup_datetime) BETWEEN '2016-01-01' AND '2016-01-07'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 2) Description: distinct pickup zones used during the week
SELECT DISTINCT pickup_location_id
FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016`
WHERE DATE(pickup_datetime) BETWEEN '2016-01-01' AND '2016-01-07'
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 3) Description: map those pickup zones to their boroughs
SELECT z.pickup_location_id, g.borough, g.zone_name
FROM (
  SELECT DISTINCT pickup_location_id
  FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016`
  WHERE DATE(pickup_datetime) BETWEEN '2016-01-01' AND '2016-01-07'
) AS z
JOIN `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.taxi_zone_geom` AS g
  ON z.pickup_location_id = g.zone_id
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 4) Description: count trips per pickup borough (raw, no filters yet)
SELECT g.borough, COUNT(*) AS trips
FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016` t
JOIN `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.taxi_zone_geom` g
  ON t.pickup_location_id = g.zone_id
WHERE DATE(pickup_datetime) BETWEEN '2016-01-01' AND '2016-01-07'
GROUP BY g.borough
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 5) Description: sample tip‑rate calculation & bucket assignment
SELECT
  tip_amount,
  fare_amount,
  ROUND(100 * tip_amount / NULLIF(fare_amount,0),2) AS tip_rate,
  CASE
      WHEN tip_amount = 0                                   THEN 'no tip'
      WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <=  5                THEN '≤5%'
      WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 10                THEN '5–10%'
      WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 15                THEN '10–15%'
      WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 20                THEN '15–20%'
      WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 25                THEN '20–25%'
      ELSE                                                      '>25%'
  END AS tip_bucket
FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016`
WHERE DATE(pickup_datetime) BETWEEN '2016-01-01' AND '2016-01-07'
  AND fare_amount > 0
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 6) Description: check distribution of tip buckets (all boroughs combined)
SELECT tip_bucket, COUNT(*) AS trips
FROM (
  SELECT
    CASE
        WHEN tip_amount = 0                                   THEN 'no tip'
        WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <=  5                THEN '≤5%'
        WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 10                THEN '5–10%'
        WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 15                THEN '10–15%'
        WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 20                THEN '15–20%'
        WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 25                THEN '20–25%'
        ELSE                                                      '>25%'
    END AS tip_bucket
  FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016`
  WHERE DATE(pickup_datetime) BETWEEN '2016-01-01' AND '2016-01-07'
    AND fare_amount > 0
) 
GROUP BY tip_bucket
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 7) Description: apply all quality‑control filters, still without bucket
SELECT *
FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016`
WHERE DATE(pickup_datetime) BETWEEN '2016-01-01' AND '2016-01-07'
  AND dropoff_datetime > pickup_datetime
  AND passenger_count > 0
  AND trip_distance >= 0
  AND tip_amount    >= 0
  AND tolls_amount  >= 0
  AND mta_tax       >= 0
  AND fare_amount   >= 0
  AND total_amount  >= 0
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 8) Description: bucketed counts per pickup borough (with filters + exclusions)
SELECT 
  g.borough,
  CASE
      WHEN tip_amount = 0                                   THEN 'no tip'
      WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <=  5                THEN '≤5%'
      WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 10                THEN '5–10%'
      WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 15                THEN '10–15%'
      WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 20                THEN '15–20%'
      WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 25                THEN '20–25%'
      ELSE                                                      '>25%'
  END AS tip_bucket,
  COUNT(*) AS trips
FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016` t
JOIN `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.taxi_zone_geom` g 
  ON t.pickup_location_id = g.zone_id
WHERE DATE(pickup_datetime) BETWEEN '2016-01-01' AND '2016-01-07'
  AND dropoff_datetime > pickup_datetime
  AND passenger_count > 0
  AND trip_distance >= 0
  AND tip_amount    >= 0
  AND tolls_amount  >= 0
  AND mta_tax       >= 0
  AND fare_amount   > 0          -- exclude zero fare to avoid div‑by‑0
  AND total_amount  >= 0
  AND g.borough NOT IN ('EWR','Staten Island')
GROUP BY g.borough, tip_bucket
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
-- 9) Description: calculate proportions of each bucket within every borough
WITH base AS (
  SELECT 
    g.borough,
    CASE
        WHEN tip_amount = 0                                   THEN 'no tip'
        WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <=  5                THEN '≤5%'
        WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 10                THEN '5–10%'
        WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 15                THEN '10–15%'
        WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 20                THEN '15–20%'
        WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 25                THEN '20–25%'
        ELSE                                                      '>25%'
    END AS tip_bucket
  FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016` t
  JOIN `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.taxi_zone_geom` g 
    ON t.pickup_location_id = g.zone_id
  WHERE DATE(pickup_datetime) BETWEEN '2016-01-01' AND '2016-01-07'
    AND dropoff_datetime > pickup_datetime
    AND passenger_count > 0
    AND trip_distance >= 0
    AND tip_amount    >= 0
    AND tolls_amount  >= 0
    AND mta_tax       >= 0
    AND fare_amount   > 0
    AND total_amount  >= 0
    AND g.borough NOT IN ('EWR','Staten Island')
)
SELECT 
  borough,
  tip_bucket,
  COUNT(*)                    AS trips,
  ROUND(100*COUNT(*)/SUM(COUNT(*)) OVER (PARTITION BY borough),2) AS pct_of_borough
FROM base
GROUP BY borough, tip_bucket
ORDER BY borough, pct_of_borough DESC
LIMIT 20;
```

```sql
--10) Description: (final form) full result set without LIMIT, ordered nicely
WITH filtered AS (
  SELECT 
    g.borough,
    CASE
        WHEN tip_amount = 0                                   THEN 'no tip'
        WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <=  5                THEN '≤5%'
        WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 10                THEN '5–10%'
        WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 15                THEN '10–15%'
        WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 20                THEN '15–20%'
        WHEN 100*tip_amount/fare_amount <= 25                THEN '20–25%'
        ELSE                                                      '>25%'
    END AS tip_bucket
  FROM `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.tlc_yellow_trips_2016` t
  JOIN `bigquery-public-data.new_york_taxi_trips.taxi_zone_geom` g
    ON t.pickup_location_id = g.zone_id
  WHERE DATE(t.pickup_datetime) BETWEEN '2016-01-01' AND '2016-01-07'
    AND t.dropoff_datetime > t.pickup_datetime
    AND t.passenger_count > 0
    AND t.trip_distance   >= 0
    AND t.tip_amount      >= 0
    AND t.tolls_amount    >= 0
    AND t.mta_tax         >= 0
    AND t.fare_amount     >  0          -- avoid division by zero
    AND t.total_amount    >= 0
    AND g.borough NOT IN ('EWR','Staten Island')
)
SELECT
  borough,
  tip_bucket,
  COUNT(*)                                  AS rides,
  ROUND(100 * COUNT(*) / SUM(COUNT(*)) OVER (PARTITION BY borough), 2) AS pct_of_borough
FROM filtered
GROUP BY borough, tip_bucket
ORDER BY borough, tip_bucket;
```

