Table full name: bigquery-public-data.new_york_trees.tree_census_2005
Column name: objectid Type: INT64 Description: 
Column name: cen_year Type: INT64 Description: This is the year the tree was inventoried in. Data collection for the 2005 census spanned multiple seasons. Data is in YYYY format.
Column name: tree_dbh Type: INT64 Description: The diameter of the tree in whole inches, measured at breast height. (4.5 feet from the ground.)
Column name: tree_loc Type: STRING Description: Establishes the location of the tree in relation to the address provided
Column name: pit_type Type: STRING Description: 
Column name: soil_lvl Type: STRING Description: 
Column name: status Type: STRING Description: Excellent: full, well balanced crown and limb structure; leaves normal size color; no dead or broken branches; trunk solid; bark intact. Good: crown uneven or misshapen; some mechanical damage to bark or trunk; some signs of insects or disease; leaves somewhat below normal size and quantity; some dead or broken branches (less than half of the tree). Poor: large dead limbs with over one- half of the tree already dead or removed; large cavities; drastic deformities; leaves significantly below normal size and quantity; severe insect or disease damage. Dead: dead tree; leaves absent; twigs brittle. Shaft: all branches removed; trunk left standing; sprouts may or may not be evident. Stump: stump shorter than breast height; leaves entirely absent or present only on stump sprouts Empty pit: Pit contains exposed soil and no tree
Column name: spc_latin Type: STRING Description: The scientific name of the species.
Column name: spc_common Type: STRING Description: The common name of the species.
Column name: vert_other Type: BOOL Description: Other Vertical Treatment Present
Column name: vert_pgrd Type: BOOL Description: Perimeter guard present
Column name: vert_tgrd Type: BOOL Description: Tall guard present
Column name: vert_wall Type: BOOL Description: Walled tree well present
Column name: horz_blck Type: BOOL Description: Block pavers present
Column name: horz_grate Type: BOOL Description: Tree grates present
Column name: horz_plant Type: BOOL Description: Plantings present
Column name: horz_other Type: BOOL Description: Other horizontal treatment present
Column name: sidw_crack Type: BOOL Description: Cracked sidewalk present
Column name: sidw_raise Type: BOOL Description: Raised sidewalk present
Column name: wire_htap Type: BOOL Description: Indicates the presence of house tap wires
Column name: wire_prime Type: BOOL Description: Indicates the presence of primary wires
Column name: wire_2nd Type: BOOL Description: Indicates the presence of secondary wires
Column name: wire_other Type: BOOL Description: Indicates the presence of other wires
Column name: inf_canopy Type: BOOL Description: Canopy debris present
Column name: inf_guard Type: BOOL Description: Choking guard or grate present
Column name: inf_wires Type: BOOL Description: Choking wires present
Column name: inf_paving Type: BOOL Description: Close paving present
Column name: inf_outlet Type: BOOL Description: Electrical outlet present
Column name: inf_shoes Type: BOOL Description: Sneakers present
